{"id":"S07","name":"双月经营","messages":["比较2026年8月和9月完成金额和到账原额。","这能证明9月经营变差了吗？请说人话。"],"app":"sculpy","check":"sculpy_report","versions":{"baseline":[{"input":"比较2026年8月和9月完成金额和到账原额。","expected":{"check":"sculpy_report","explicitConfirmationRequired":true},"status":200,"elapsed":7817,"errors":[],"output":{"turn":{"id":"888f55cb-fa6f-47f6-aa84-2b540eb10e58","user":"比较2026年8月和9月完成金额和到账原额。","modelProfile":{"model":"gpt-6-sol"},"answer":"这是**虚构演示数据**。2026 年 9 月比 8 月，两项金额都下降了：\n\n| 口径 | 8 月 | 9 月 | 变化 |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|\n| 已完成订单金额（按服务日期） | CAD 26,025.00 | CAD 19,685.00 | 少 CAD 6,340.00（24.4%） |\n| 到账原额（按收款日期，未扣退款） | CAD 21,235.00 | CAD 13,725.00 | 少 CAD 7,510.00（35.4%） |\n\n9 月完成订单从 26 单降到 21 单，一单平均成交金额也从 CAD 1,000.96 降到 CAD 937.38；这两点都与完成金额下降有关。到账降得更快，但**不能直接把两个月的金额差当成欠款**：服务和收款可能不在同一个月。\n\n你先看 9 月已完成、却没有记录收款日期的 **615622、615703** 等单，确认是付款未录、尚未付款，还是约定在之后收款；核清后再判断现金安排需不需要调整。","references":[],"proposals":[],"demoReportSources":[{"source":"current_fictional_demo_full_catalog","fictional":true,"asOfDate":"2026-10-16","filters":{"from":"2026-08-01","to":"2026-08-31","service":null,"channelId":null,"artistId":null,"bookingId":null,"venueId":null,"status":null,"groupBy":null},"coverage":{"catalogRecords":300,"scopedRecords":300,"allMatchingRowsAggregated":true},"records":34,"completed":26,"pricedCompleted":26,"averageCompletedAmountCents":100096,"completedAmountCents":2602500,"grossReceivedCents":2123500,"unpricedCompleted":0,"nonCadCompleted":0,"catalogQuality":{"futureDatedReceipts":26,"futureCompleted":32,"completedOnOrBeforeAsOf":190,"invalidServiceDates":0}},{"source":"current_fictional_demo_full_catalog","fictional":true,"asOfDate":"2026-10-16","filters":{"from":"2026-09-01","to":"2026-09-30","service":null,"channelId":null,"artistId":null,"bookingId":null,"venueId":null,"status":null,"groupBy":null},"coverage":{"catalogRecords":300,"scopedRecords":300,"allMatchingRowsAggregated":true},"records":28,"completed":21,"pricedCompleted":21,"averageCompletedAmountCents":93738