},{"input":"这能证明9月经营变差了吗？请说人话。","expected":{"check":"sculpy_report","explicitConfirmationRequired":true},"status":200,"elapsed":12572,"errors":[],"output":{"turn":{"id":"91dea152-905d-41ac-891b-2b885e0af088","user":"这能证明9月经营变差了吗？请说人话。","answer":"不能证明“9 月经营整体变差了”，但**9 月确实比 8 月弱，值得盯住**。这份虚构模拟数据里，完成订单从 26 单降到 21 单，完成金额从 CAD 26,025.00 降到 CAD 19,685.00；一单平均成交价也从 CAD 1,000.96 降到 CAD 937.38。也就是说，不只是少做了几单，每单卖的钱也略少了。\n\n到账原额降得更多：从 CAD 21,235.00 降到 CAD 13,725.00。但到账看的是**钱在哪个月进账**，不一定对应当月完成的服务，所以不能把这个降幅直接当成生意变差的程度。只比相邻两个月，也分不清是季节变化、服务种类变了，还是需求真的走弱；更不能据此判断利润。\n\n你先做一件实在的事：**把 8、9 月同类服务放在一起比**，看少的是哪类订单；同时核对 9 月已完成但未记录到账的 **b79、b84、b89**。这样才能分清是接单问题，还是收款时间、记录问题。","references":[],"proposals":[],"sourceIds":[],"skillsUsed":["business","finance"],"modelProfile":{"model":"gpt-6-sol","effort":"medium"},"demoReportSources":[{"source":"current_fictional_demo_full_catalog","fictional":true,"asOfDate":"2026-10-16","filters":{"from":"2026-08-01","to":"2026-08-31","service":null,"channelId":null,"artistId":null,"bookingId":null,"venueId":null,"status":null,"groupBy":null},"coverage":{"catalogRecords":300,"scopedRecords":300,"allMatchingRowsAggregated":true},"records":34,"completed":26,"pricedCompleted":26,"averageCompletedAmountCents":100096,"completedAmountCents":2602500,"grossReceivedCents":2123500,"unpricedCompleted":0,"nonCadCompleted":0,"catalogQuality":{"futureDatedReceipts":26,"futureCompleted":32,"completedOnOrBeforeAsOf":190,"invalidServiceDates":0}},{"source":"current_fictional_demo_full_catalog","fictional":true,"asOfDate":"2026-10-16","filters":{"from":"2026-09-01","to":"2026-09-30","service":null,"channelId":null,"artistId":null,"bookingId":null,"venueId":null,"status":null,"groupBy":null},"coverage":{"catalogRecords":300,"scopedRecords":300,"allMatchingRowsAggregated":true},"records":28,"completed":21,"pricedCompleted":21,"averageCompletedAmountCents":93738,"completedAmountCents":1968500,"grossReceivedCents":1372500,"unpricedCompleted":0,"nonCadCompleted":0,"catalogQuality":{"